From 1079d964d5dd8cc9aeb09f9e1da2312ef482acf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:50:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/18] Add Continue: save furthest checkpoint and resume from
 it

Continued runs are flagged and never write best-time records, since they
skip the earlier part of the tower. Starting fresh or finishing clears
the saved checkpoint.
